---
// Twitter's two operations, bars drawn to scale from the post's numbers (5,000 writes/s, 300,000 reads/s).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
import NfrText from './NfrText.astro';
import './nfr-fig.css';
const W = 900;
const H = 230;
const X0 = 250;
const SCALE = 400 / 300000;
const wEnd = X0 + 5000 * SCALE;
const rEnd = X0 + 300000 * SCALE;
---
<figure class="nf">
  <div class="nf-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Bars to scale: about 5,000 tweets posted per second versus about 300,000 home timeline reads per second, more than 50 reads for every write.">
      <DiagramIcon name="file" x={40} y={52} size={30} />
      <NfrText x={70} y={50} cls="n" en="Post a tweet" vi="Đăng tweet" />
      <NfrText x={70} y={68} cls="s" en="a write" vi="một lệnh ghi" />
      <rect x={X0} y="38" width={Math.max(wEnd - X0, 3)} height="28" rx="3" class="bar" />
      <NfrText x={wEnd + 12} y={57} en="about 5,000 per second (12,000+ at peak)" vi="khoảng 5,000 mỗi giây (đỉnh hơn 12,000)" />

      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={40} y={124} size={30} />
      <NfrText x={70} y={122} cls="n" en="Read home timeline" vi="Xem bảng tin" />
      <NfrText x={70} y={140} cls="s" en="a read" vi="một lệnh đọc" />
      <rect x={X0} y="110" width={rEnd - X0} height="28" rx="3" class="bar is-gold" />
      <NfrText x={rEnd + 12} y={129} cls="num" en="about 300,000 per second" vi="khoảng 300,000 mỗi giây" />

      <rect x="250" y="168" width="400" height="44" rx="8" class="box is-gold" />
      <NfrText x={450} y={195} anchor="middle" cls="n" en="Reads outnumber writes by more than 50 to 1" vi="Lượt đọc nhiều hơn lượt ghi hơn 50 lần" />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Bar lengths are to scale. The write bar is the thin one at the top. A design that makes reads cheap pays off even if writes get costlier.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Độ dài cột theo đúng tỉ lệ. Cột ghi là cột mỏng ở trên. Thiết kế làm cho đọc rẻ sẽ có lợi, dù ghi có đắt hơn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
